[size=4]Mantella Living World - OStim Expansion[/size]

Mantella NPCs who live through OStim scenes with you: scenes that flow on their own, and partners who react, talk and remember.

[size=3]Features[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Feature[/th][th]What it does[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]Scene flows[/td][td]Builds each scene live from your own animation packs[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Finish scenes[/td][td]Played when the man is close; borrowed from another pack if needed[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Not satisfied?[/td][td]A new round starts in the same pack after her climax[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Your control[/td][td]Pick a scene yourself and the flow steps back[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Favourite positions[/td][td]Rated from her personality, learned from your scenes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Position requests[/td][td]Ask her in conversation; she switches if it fits[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Group scenes[/td][td]Scene talk names everyone; flows stay two-person[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]How a scene flows[/size]
[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1704/images/196850/196850-1793005727-1382186894.png[/img]

[size=3]What Mantella hears during a scene[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Moment[/th][th]Example line[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]Scene starts or moves on[/td][td]Vega and the player have started: a blowjob.[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Excitement 30 / 50 / 75[/td][td]Vega is really into it now; she reacts out loud.[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Pace change[/td][td]The pace picks up; it is now steady.[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Climax[/td][td]Vega just climaxed.  (+ a remark from someone watching)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Scene ends[/td][td]One summary: where, how long, what you did, climaxes.[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]Requirements[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Mod[/th][th]Needed[/th][/tr]
[tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98163]OStim Standalone[/url] and an animation pack[/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196851]Mantella Living World - Arousal[/url][/td][td]Recommended[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]Installation[/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install the hub, then this module.
[*]Close the game and run Build Flows.exe (reads your animation packs).
[*]Enable the generated Flows mod in your mod manager.
[*]Run Build Flows again whenever you add or remove animation packs.
[/list]

[size=3]Settings[/size]
[list]
[*]OStim's MCM, page "Adult Expansion": flows, finish point, talk chance, bystanders, never force a scene.
[/list]
